                <p>I have a demonstrated track record of gathering requirements from artists, designers, and producers; aligning priorities across disciplines; scoping and driving cross-team delivery; presenting deliverables to stakeholders; and producing documentation and tutorials to ensure adoption. I understand that shipping a feature is only half the job – the other half is ensuring people can discover, learn, and benefit from it.</p>

                <p>My technical background spans <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/tools" class="textual-link" target="_blank">authoring tools<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>, <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/systems" class="textual-link" target="_blank">systems<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>, <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/backend" class="textual-link" target="_blank">backend infrastructure<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>, <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/multiplayer" class="textual-link" target="_blank">multiplayer<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>, <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/gameplay" class="textual-link" target="_blank">gameplay<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>, and <b><a href="@explicitBaseUri/portfolio/technicalart" class="textual-link" target="_blank">technical art<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></b>.</p>
                
