                    <li><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fydar" target="_blank"><SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-linkedin-inverted" Alt="LinkedIn" />/in/fydar<SvgSprite Link="/icons.svg?v=1#icon-external-link" class="external-link-icon" /></a></li>
